icchezza della diversità e le sue opere si rivelano nel tempo un dono per l’intera collettività."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Hidden Away","overview":"The film tackles the life journey of Toni Ligabue, visionary naïf painter who used to draw tigers, lions and jaguars while living among the poplar trees of the boundless Po valley. A harsh life that is a fairy tale too, as a lonely and marginalized kid finds redemption in his art, and a way to express himself and be admired by the world."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/znkT7ke3WKz6wfvBCoCA7s8cvz8.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yGPNJns2G4j7FuJw3vDVYJhIgxa.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":608317,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/znkT7ke3WKz6wfvBCoCA7s8cvz8.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/znkT7ke3WKz6wfvBCoCA7s8cvz8.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/znkT7ke3WKz6wfvBCoCA7s8cvz8.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/znkT7ke3WKz6wfvBCoCA7s8cvz8.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p0qUysVaC55cLj9IphjMzyLLioB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p0qUysVaC55cLj9IphjMzyLLioB.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mI6vJaKvdGuF980OjSwFsJkfUYp.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mI6vJaKvdGuF980OjSwFsJkfUYp.jpg","language":"it","width":672,"height":960},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6UQrvSPkutM7wLmcTjOlWmQEEei.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6UQrvSPkutM7wLmcTjOlWmQEEei.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]}